      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1u7yFTKP6Y_W8TVKQbP41_2Si8ZdfDbVb?usp=sharing\n\nHere is a video and related logs.\n\nThis happens when I wake up and reconnect to Virtual Desktop. \n\nBefore I went asleep, I anchord my feet (VRC Animator Locomotion Control in Animation Controller).\n\nNo expression menu is being touched during the record and the only thing I did is simply move my head foward, the stand-still or feet-under-head poses are completely unexpected for the locomotion layer.",
